"""Mutations of the rigid body's actors (src/game/item_actor.cpp and debris.cpp, part 6a) for
../mutfast.py with the actors build:

    python mutfast.py mutations/mutate_items.py --models DIR --build build_item.bat --check check_item.py

Each should make check_item.py fail (or the harness crash / hang). Left out as equivalent: the
normalization's NaN test (`!(sq < 1e-8f)` against `sq >= 1e-8f`), Point4's w and the direction's w
(the impulse's point and the frames' matrices have none), the creators' Destroy (memory only), the
save's rotation from the local matrix (the item frames have no parent), the respawn search's break
against the last match only when two placements share an item (tested: the first wins).

Results (2026-10-25, 276): the first run caught 275 (12 by a crash); "load ascend body" survived (the
body's chunk is the last saved, so the missing Ascend changed nothing) and is caught since the test
also loads a file with the body's chunk first."""
